        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 8225, Minneapolis Touchscreen Keypad Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Minneapolis Touchscreen Electronic Deadbolt is the next step in home security. This electronic touchscreen deadbolt can hold up to 16 different codes so that everyone can have their own. It is easy to program, ensuring that only the people who you want to have access to your home do. The Minneapolis Touchscreen Keypad Deadbolt features a modern appearance perfect for tech-lovers. It will fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/4 inches or 2-3/8 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Minneapolis Touchscreen Electronic Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA Grade 2</li>\r\n<li>SecureScreen™ Technology that provides additional security by employing random digits prior to entering your personal code to prevent fingerprint and code detection.</li>\r\n<li>Lock your door with a single touch.</li>\r\n<li>Up to 16 customizable user codes with 4 to 8 digit code length</li>\r\n<li>White LED  illuminates the keypad when needed.</li>\r\n<li>30 second auto-locking feature.</li>\r\n<li>UL certified 20 minute fire rating.</li>\r\n<li>1-Year electronics warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin 8225 Minneapolis Keypad Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Height: 5.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Faceplate: 1\" x 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backup Keyway: Schlage C Keyway 5 Pin Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Battery: 4 AA batteries </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
